#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""niix-iconify - NiiX icons for installed apps.

Every NiiX icon is the same dark rounded tile with one Tabler Icons (MIT)
line drawing in teal or pink. This draws one for every app icon the theme
doesn't have yet, picking the drawing from the app's name and categories.
Icons shipped with the theme are never touched.

  niix-iconify                      add the missing icons
  niix-iconify --quiet              without per-icon output
  niix-iconify --force              also redraw icons made here before
  niix-iconify --prune              remove made icons no app uses any more
  niix-iconify --add NAME GLYPH [pink]   add one icon by hand
  niix-iconify --list-glyphs        the available drawings

The ISO build also draws the theme's own icons with tile().
"""
